SUMMARY:Walk the Middle 5 KM of Maggie Valley
DESCRIPTION:Haywood County Walking Meetup Group\nMeet at Parham Memorial P
 ark\, 1861 State Rd 1307 (Moody Farm Rd)\, Maggie Valley 28751. This is th
 e park at the western intersection of Moody Farm Rd with Soco Rd. We will 
 meet at 2:00 p.m. Be forewarned: the restrooms at the park are closed for 
 renovation\; plan accordingly.\n\nThe walk is pretty flat. Tennis shoes ar
 e fine\; walking poles aren't needed. Dress appropriately for the weather.
  Bring lots of water and a protein snack. Dogs are welcome. Strollers are 
 fine.\n\nWe will walk west on Soco Road for a mile and a half. We will cro
 ss Soco Road at Town Hall. We will walk east on the opposite side of Soco 
 Road\, finally returning to the Start Point.\n\nSights along the way inclu
 de Inspiration Park\, Wheels through Time Motorcycle Museum\, Maggie Valle
 y Festival Grounds\, and Elevated Creek Park.\n\nThis is a short\, easy wa
 lk\, mostly on pavement. Hope to see you there!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/haywood-county-walking-meetup-group/e
 vents/313657789/
